{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13310400","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13310400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1331040001:1":{"text":"ケホッ、ケホッ……ねぇ、もう何度も説明したじゃないか。","source_cn":"咳咳，亲爱的，我已经和你解释过很多次，去年的事情不能全怪我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971D3CD2974863EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1331040002:1":{"text":"去年の舞踏会では君の仮装が良すぎたのと、会場の照明が暗すぎたんだって……","source_cn":"你去年舞会的妆实在化的太好，而且当时舞会的光线太暗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA31A2AE9F05E8AC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1331040003:0":{"text":"とにかく、今年は自分の妻を見間違えたりしないでよね。","source_cn":"亲爱的，希望你今年不会再次弄丢自己的老婆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF66BE48408FBAB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民奥利维":{"text":"町民のオリヴィ","source":"镇民奥利维","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:镇民娜杰":{"text":"町民のナジェ","source":"镇民娜杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}